5" class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUyNDcyOC8yMDk5ODA1NS5wbmc=/147x117%23/gpjLR9.png"/></a><a data-image_lightbox="true" target="_blank" href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUyNDcyOC8yMTQxMzIyMS5wbmc=/original/DDG2v4.png"><img data-screenshot_id="21413221" class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUyNDcyOC8yMTQxMzIyMS5wbmc=/147x117%23/KJsPV0.png"/></a><a data-image_lightbox="true" target="_blank" href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUyNDcyOC8yMTQxMzIyMi5wbmc=/original/yAN423.png"><img data-screenshot_id="21413222" class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUyNDcyOC8yMTQxMzIyMi5wbmc=/147x117%23/DnwIft.png"/></a></div></div><div class="main_column"><section class="visit_game"><h2>Play game</h2><a class="button fat play_btn" href="https://narane-yo.itch.io/majokko">走れ魔女っ子！&#039;s itch.io page<svg width="24" class="svgicon icon_arrow_up_right" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden role="img" height="24" fill="none"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></section><section class="field_responses"><p><strong>ジャンル</strong><br/><span>おそらくやるゲ</span></p><p><strong>使用ツール</strong><br/><span>s2003MP</span></p><p><strong>配信・動画化の可否</strong><br/><span>双方おｋ</span></p><p><strong>作者</strong><br/><span>ナラネーヨ</span></p><p><strong>作者コメント</strong><br/>5月1日にプロジェクト立ち上げました<br />5月28日に提出しました<br />サクっと遊べるゲームです<br />GW約30日目をお届けします<br />―――――――――――――――――――――――――――<br />○これから本体をDLする場合<br />　既にパッチが適用されているので<br />　パッチのDLや適用は不要です<br />○パッチの当て方<br />　修正パッチ内に説明画像が同梱されています<br />○遊び方（起動が出来ない等）について<br />　本体フォルダ内に説明画像が同梱されています</p><p><strong>感想・バグ報告先</strong><br/><a href="https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/game/61468/1746187472/l50" rel="nofollow">https://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/game/61468/1746187472/l50</a></p></section><section class="jam_comment_form"><h2>Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a data-register_action="comment" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3524728">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p></section><section class="jam_comment_list" id="comments"><h2>Comments</h2><div class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget" id="community_topic_posts_3553409"><div class="community_post_list_widget base_widget" id="community_post_list_6437573"><div id="post-13001108" class="community_post sidebar_avatar" data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:13001108,&quot;user_id&quot;:13372085}"><div class="post_anchor" id="first-post"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/tkooler"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/tkooler">tkooler</a></span><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3481228"><span class="author_flag">Submitted</span></a><span class="post_date" title="2025-05-29 13:51:40"><a href="/post/13001108">1 year ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>やるゲが面白くて下の方全然見てなかったです</p></div><div class="related_submission"><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3481228"><div class="lazy_image_widget base_widget" id="lazy_image_5361639"></div></a><div class="submission_summary"><div class="sub">Submitted</div><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3481228">もしも生活保護だったら</a></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3524728&amp;intent=community"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3524728&amp;intent=community">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div id="post-1277